rk/doujin/RJ01085000/RJ01084601_img_main.jpg", "thumb": "https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ01085000/RJ01084601_img_main_240x240.jpg", "samples": ["https://img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/work/doujin/RJ01085000/RJ01084601_img_smp1.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/work/doujin/RJ01085000/RJ01084601_img_smp2.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/work/doujin/RJ01085000/RJ01084601_img_smp3.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/work/doujin/RJ01085000/RJ01084601_img_smp4.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/work/doujin/RJ01085000/RJ01084601_img_smp5.jpg"], "sample_thumbs": ["https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ01085000/RJ01084601_img_smp1_100x100.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ01085000/RJ01084601_img_smp2_100x100.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ01085000/RJ01084601_img_smp3_100x100.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ01085000/RJ01084601_img_smp4_100x100.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ01085000/RJ01084601_img_smp5_100x100.jpg"], "alt": "俺がダチの厳しいママの相手をしてやる [Hoi Hoi Hoi]"}, "introductions": [{"type": "text", "title": "", "body": [{"intro": "回想部屋あり<br />\r\n基本CG 30枚 (Live2Dで動く+喘ぎ声)<br />\r\nイベント回収型RPG<br />\r\n<br />\r\n攻略/Guide:<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://waterbears423.com/~hoi/#/guide/vs06\" target=\"_blank\">https://waterbears423.com/~hoi/#/guide/vs06</a><br />\r\n<br />\r\nTWITTER<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://twitter.com/hoi0609\" target=\"_blank\">https://twitter.com/hoi0609</a>"}]}, {"type": "text", "title": "俺がダチの厳しいママの相手をしてやる", "body": [{"intro": "陽斗と同じ母子家庭の隣人・冬樹がダチになった。<br />\r\nある日、陽斗と冬樹がエロゲをしてるところを冬樹の母・美緒に見つかってしまった。<br />\r\n冬樹はきっと陽斗に悪い影響を与えられたと思い込んだ美緒が決意した、<br />\r\n息子を陽斗と遊ばせないようにすると。<br />\r\n冬樹は確かに部屋で勉強をさせられているようだ。<br />\r\nそれで陽斗も決めた、絶対にダチをそのママから解放すると。<br />\r\n<br />\r\n「「……すべては冬樹のために……!」」"}]}, {"type": "text", "title": "我來當死黨那嚴格媽媽的對手", "body": [{"intro": "陽斗跟同樣是單親家庭的鄰居冬樹成為了死黨。<br />\r\n某天陽斗和冬樹被冬樹的媽媽美緒發現他們在玩色情遊戲。<br />\r\n然後,認為一定是陽斗把冬樹帶壞的美緒下了決定,不再讓兒子跟陽斗玩。<br />\r\n而冬樹確實似乎被強迫著在房間裡讀書。<br />\r\n於是陽斗也決定了,絕對要把死黨從他媽媽手中解放出來。<br />\r\n<br />\r\n「「……一切都是為了冬樹……!」」"}]}, {"type": "text", "title": "I'm Gonna Be My Buddy's Strict Mama's Partner", "body": [{"intro": "Akito and his next-door neighbor, Fuyuki are both from fatherless families and become best friends.<br />\r\nOne day, Fuyuki's mother, Mio finds them playing a hentai game.<br />\r\nMio thinks that Fuyuki must be influenced by Akito in a bad way, so she makes a decision.<br />\r\nShe doesn't let her son play with Akito anymore.<br />\r\nFuyuki certainly seems to be forced to study in his room.<br />\r\nSo Akito also decides that he will definitely free his buddy from his mother.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\"\"...All for Fuyuki...!\"\""}]}], "description": "ダチをその厳しいママから守るRPG", "short_introduction": "ダチをその厳しいママから守るRPG", "url": "https://www.dlsite.com/maniax/work/=/product_id/RJ01084601.html", "site_id": "maniax", "fetched_at": 1794952600}